    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i was looking at the specs for those new smart sneakers from [Brand] and the sensor array seems way overkill for just \"tracking steps.\" like they're basically bio-sensors. is there any actual info out there about them using gait and heart rate to build psychological profiles on users? seems like a huge privacy loophole if they're doing it covertly.",
